---
// Services → Architecture — How MekongMind works
---

<section
  id="architecture"
  class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50"
  aria-labelledby="arch-heading"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 max-w-6xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2
        id="arch-heading"
        class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-900 leading-snug"
      >
        How it works
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        One CLI. Two engines. Infinite possibilities.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Engine 1: mekong-cli -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-200">
        <h3 class="mb-1 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">mekong-cli</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-sky-700 font-medium mb-4">AI OS Core Engine</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
            25 MCP tools — memory, tasks, plans, agents, SSJ, trading, monitor
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
            Multi-provider LLM routing (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, MLX)
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
            Plan store — goal decomposition, task tracking, JSON persistence
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
            SSJ diagnostics, health checks, reload config, plugin management
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
            Polar.sh billing integration — usage metering, subscriptions, webhooks
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Engine 2: mekong-ide -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-200">
        <h3 class="mb-1 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">mekong-ide</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-sky-700 font-medium mb-4">AI-Native IDE Client</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
            OpenCode fork with @mekong/ai-os client SDK
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
            Typed MCP client — invoke all 25 tools with full type safety
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
            Integration test suite (7 tests, all passing)
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
            StdioClientTransport — no zombie processes, clean lifecycle
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5" /></svg>
            TypeScript typecheck: 0 errors
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
